 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Light, fast running socks are a cheap and delicious way to make running more pleasant. Cold weather running requires layering that can be easily sheddable. A light jacket you can hood is especially useful. A simple digital watch with an alarm is enough for most people. If you head out in bad weather, or get lost, a smartwatch is worth every penny. A simple set of reflectors and a headlamp is enough. Socks are the one bit of kit you can't skimp on, so treat yourself.",
